    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> Magic action (3 times per dawn): pull a fuzzy object and throw it up to 20 ft; it becomes a creature from the bag's table (roll <strong>Pull Fuzzy Object</strong> for the d8, then use your bag colour's summon and pick that creature). The creature is Friendly, acts right after you, follows your Bonus Action commands, and vanishes at the next dawn or at 0 HP.</p>",
